            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kreuz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clubs, diamonds, hearts, and spades each have thirteen ranks. Suit matters for flushes and his nobs. Most fifteens, pairs, and runs care about rank or value instead." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kreuz, Karo, Herz und Pik haben je dreizehn Ränge. Die Farbe zählt für den Flush und His Nobs. Die meisten Fünfzehnen, Paare und Folgen hängen dagegen von Rang oder Wert ab."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Combinations totaling fifteen are worth %lld points here. Court cards count 10 and the ace counts 1." : {
