    },
    "Didn't use it enough" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zu wenig genutzt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard Playbook" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Abwurf-Leitfaden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard These 2" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Diese 2 abwerfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard choices can set up the crib before the cut is turned." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Der Abwurf kann die Crib vorbereiten, bevor die Startkarte aufgedeckt wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Discard the 5" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Die 5 abwerfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do not feed the crib" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Füttere die Crib nicht"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Do you add the bonus?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zählst du den Bonus?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Does a run need matching suits?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Braucht eine Folge gleiche Farben?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Done" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Fertig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Double tap to choose this plan" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Doppeltippen, um diesen Tarif zu wählen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Duplicate ranks can multiply a run, so sort before discarding." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Doppelte Ränge können eine Folge vervielfachen, also sortiere vor dem Abwerfen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During pegging, points come from making 15, pairs, runs, 31, go, and the last card. The same cards can score differently in this phase because order matters." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beim Pegging gibt es Punkte für 15, Paare, Folgen, 31, Go und die letzte Karte. Dieselben Karten können in dieser Phase anders punkten, weil die Reihenfolge zählt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During pegging, what do you announce when the running total reaches 15?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Was sagst du beim Pegging an, wenn der Stand 15 erreicht?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During pegging, which card is often safest to lead from a small connected hand?" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Welche Karte ist beim Pegging aus einer kleinen, verbundenen Hand oft am sichersten zum Anspielen?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "During the hand count, the same starter joins your hand and the crib. During pegging, the discarded cards are gone, so use the information to estimate what remains." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beim Zählen gehört dieselbe Startkarte zu deiner Hand und zur Crib. Beim Pegging sind die abgeworfenen Karten aus dem Spiel, also nutze das Wissen, um abzuschätzen, was noch übrig ist."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each 5 makes fifteen with the 10 and again with the jack. Four fifteens is 8 points, before the pair of 5s adds 2 more." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede 5 ergibt Fünfzehn mit der 10 und noch einmal mit dem Buben. Vier Fünfzehnen sind 8 Punkte, und das Paar 5er bringt noch 2 dazu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each distinct combination totaling 15 scores 2 points." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede eigene Kombination mit der Summe 15 bringt 2 Punkte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each player contributes two cards, so the dealer's crib has four cards before the starter joins it." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder Spieler legt zwei Karten hinein, also hat die Crib des Gebers vier Karten, bevor die Startkarte dazukommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each player discards exactly two cards. The dealer's crib then contains four cards before the starter is cut." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder Spieler wirft genau zwei Karten ab. Die Crib des Gebers hat dann vier Karten, bevor die Startkarte abgehoben wird."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each player receives six cards and discards exactly two. The four cards you keep are your hand. Both players' discards make up the dealer's crib." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder Spieler bekommt sechs Karten und wirft genau zwei ab. Die vier Karten, die du behältst, sind deine Hand. Die Abwürfe beider Spieler bilden die Crib des Gebers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each player receives six cards and discards two to the dealer's crib. The non-dealer cuts the starter card, which joins both hands and the crib for scoring." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder Spieler bekommt sechs Karten und wirft zwei in die Crib des Gebers. Die Vorhand hebt die Startkarte ab, die beim Zählen zu beiden Händen und zur Crib gehört."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eight more deals: flushes, pairs, board position, and defense" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Acht weitere Deals: Flushes, Paare, Spielstand und Verteidigung"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endless\nPractice" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Endlos-\nTraining"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endless Practice" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Endlos-Training"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endless Practice deals a fresh hand every time" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Endlos-Training gibt jedes Mal eine frische Hand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endless Practice deals hands that never run out, every room keeps a set of extra drills behind the lock, and the Master Tables hold the advanced ones. Nothing you have now goes away. Unlock any time from Home or Settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Endlos-Training gibt unbegrenzt Hände, jeder Raum hält ein Set Extra-Übungen hinter dem Schloss bereit, und die Meistertische enthalten die Profi-Übungen. Nichts, was du jetzt hast, geht verloren. Freischalten kannst du jederzeit auf dem Startbildschirm oder in den Einstellungen."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endless Practice, freshly dealt hands" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Endlos-Training, frisch gegebene Hände"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endless Practice, timed challenges, and %lld more drills across every room" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Endlos-Training, Gegen die Uhr und %lld weitere Übung in allen Räumen"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Endlos-Training, Gegen die Uhr und %lld weitere Übungen in allen Räumen"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Endless Practice, timed challenges, and %lld more drill across every room"
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Endless Practice, timed challenges, and %lld more drills across every room"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endless Practice: a fresh hand dealt every time" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Endlos-Training: jedes Mal eine frische Hand"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Endless four-card hands with a starter. Add up fifteens, pairs, runs, flushes and nobs, then see exactly where every point came from." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Endlos Hände aus vier Karten mit Startkarte. Zähl Fünfzehnen, Paare, Folgen, Flushes und Nobs zusammen und sieh genau, woher jeder Punkt kommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every 5 makes fifteen with the 10 and again with the jack, and the three 5s together also total fifteen. Seven fifteens is 14 points, before 6 more for the three pairs." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede 5 ergibt Fünfzehn mit der 10 und noch einmal mit dem Buben, und die drei 5er ergeben zusammen ebenfalls Fünfzehn. Sieben Fünfzehnen sind 14 Punkte, dazu kommen noch 6 für die drei Paare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every answer shows the rule, the observation, and why the choice works at the table." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Antwort zeigt die Regel, die Beobachtung und warum die Wahl am Tisch funktioniert."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every beginner room is free, forever" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jeder Anfängerraum ist kostenlos, für immer"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every combination counts" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Kombination zählt"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every distinct combination totaling 15 scores 2 points. A hand can contain several fifteens, and each one is counted separately." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede eigene Kombination mit der Summe 15 bringt 2 Punkte. Eine Hand kann mehrere Fünfzehnen enthalten, und jede wird einzeln gezählt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every face card counts as 10 for fifteens, even though its rank stays jack, queen, or king for pairs and runs." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Bildkarte zählt für Fünfzehnen 10, auch wenn ihr Rang für Paare und Folgen Bube, Dame oder König bleibt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every hand here is dealt fresh the moment you see it, so you can practise for as long as you like without repeating a question." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Hand wird frisch gegeben, sobald du sie siehst. So kannst du üben, so lange du willst, ohne dass sich eine Frage wiederholt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every hand you count here is one you'll read faster at the table." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Jede Hand, die du hier zählst, liest du am Tisch schneller."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Everything you have stays free. %@ adds practice that never runs out." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Alles, was du hast, bleibt kostenlos. %@ bringt Übung, die nie ausgeht."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Expert Counting" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zählen für Experten"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Explanations that stick" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
