            "value" : "%@ gratis testen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try again" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Erneut versuchen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tuesday" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dienstag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Twelve more hands with overlapping scoring patterns" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwölf weitere Hände mit überlappenden Punktmustern"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two 3s and two 4s let 3-4-5 form four different ways, 12 points of runs. Add 4 for the two pairs and 4 for the two fifteens and the hand counts 20." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei 3er und zwei 4er lassen 3-4-5 auf vier verschiedene Arten entstehen, 12 Punkte aus Folgen. Dazu 4 für die zwei Paare und 4 für die zwei Fünfzehnen, und die Hand zählt 20."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two cards of the same rank make one pair worth 2 points." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Karten gleichen Rangs bilden ein Paar für 2 Punkte."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two cards of the same rank score a pair. Three of a rank makes three pairs, and four makes six pairs." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Karten desselben Rangs ergeben ein Paar. Drei eines Rangs ergeben drei Paare, vier ergeben sechs Paare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two cards to the crib" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Karten in die Crib"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two cards with the same rank score 2 points. Three of a kind contains three separate pairs, and four of a kind contains six." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Karten mit gleichem Rang bringen 2 Punkte. Ein Drilling enthält drei einzelne Paare, ein Vierling sechs."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two combinations reach fifteen: the 6 with the 9, and the 5 with the queen. No rank repeats and nothing runs three deep, so 4 points of fifteens is the whole count." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Kombinationen ergeben Fünfzehn: die 6 mit der 9 und die 5 mit der Dame. Kein Rang wiederholt sich und es gibt keine Folge aus drei Karten, also sind 4 Punkte aus Fünfzehnen die ganze Zählung."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two fifteens" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Fünfzehnen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two flushes" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Flushes"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two points per pair" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zwei Punkte pro Paar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo last answer" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Letzte Antwort rückgängig"
          }
        }
      }
    },
