    "Use a fixed order and check every combination" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Feste Reihenfolge, jede Kombination prüfen"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use a standard 52-card deck. Aces are low and count as 1. Number cards keep their values, while jacks, queens, and kings count as 10 for fifteens." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Gespielt wird mit einem normalen 52-Karten-Deck. Asse sind niedrig und zählen 1. Zahlenkarten behalten ihren Wert, Buben, Damen und Könige zählen für Fünfzehnen 10."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use the same order every time. Count fifteens first, then pairs, runs, flushes, and his nobs. Add the starter-driven bonuses as you go." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Nutze jedes Mal dieselbe Reihenfolge. Zähl zuerst die Fünfzehnen, dann Paare, Folgen, Flushes und His Nobs. Boni durch die Startkarte rechnest du gleich mit."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Useful cuts are a distribution, not one favorite card." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
